{
  "_readme": [
    "The layered tile art the Quest home screen draws its system apps with: a",
    "background plate and a foreground icon, composed on the shelf rather than",
    "shipped as one picture. The store API does not publish these — they are a",
    "table inside the Navigator panel app (com.oculus.panelapp.library), which",
    "holds one CDN entry token per asset and hands the pair to its tile.",
    "Two sets exist: rlds is the older theme, aura the current one. An app with",
    "only \"both\" has a single pair used under either theme.",
    "Each pair is [background, foreground]. The URL is base + the entry token;",
    "they need no token and no relay, and come back as 180x180 PNGs with alpha.",
    "Read out of the Navigator at version 1046.0.0.217.430; 78 of the 84 assets",
    "in that table are claimed by a package, the other six by nothing."
  ],
